      "description_zh": "快照类型。\n\n- Archive：归档快照",
      "example": "Archive",
      "help_en": "The snapshot type.\n\n- Archive: archive snapshot",
      "help_zh": "快照类型。\n\n- Archive：归档快照",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "category",
      "options": [
